nsurance limit\nshall not be less than\nRMB 100,000;\n2. Medical liability for accidental injury\n: insurance limit\nshall not be less than RMB 20,000;\n3. For hospitalization liability\n: insurance limit\nshall not be less than RMB 400,000\n;\n4. For outpatient and emergency medical liability\n: insurance limit\nshall not be less than RMB 20,000;\n5. For death care services\n: insurance limit\nshall not be less than RMB 200,000.\nInsurance service agencies shall provide insurance claims consultation, medical guidance and hospitalization/aftercare related expenses advance and other whole-process management services.\nII\n. Insurance cost standard for scholarship students\nRMB\n400/\nhalf year,\nRMB\n800/\nyear.\nIII.\nPurchase process example please see:\nwebsite\n,\nmobile\nAbout us\nAbout Beijing\nAbout BNU\nAbout ISO\nFamous Professors\nStudy & Life\nOrientation\nStudents Association\nFacilities\nInternship & Employment\nCopyright © 2016 Beijing Normal University. All rights reserved\nTechnical Support:\nCUCAS"
